  "description": "<p>In Bloom first opened in 2013 in historic downtown Smyrna, Tennessee. We always knew that we wanted to serve as many customers as possible, and as we grew, new doors opened for us (literally!), and we opened a new store just ten miles away in Murfreesboro, Tennessee.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Serving women of all ages, we strive to always provide you with the best in comfort, style, and quality. We believe you should be able to come into our store or shop our website and find the perfect clothing and accessories for any event.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>We pride ourselves on excellent customer service and experience. Styles are ever-changing! You can trust us to keep up with all the trends, to keep you looking fresh, and feel empowered to conquer all the challenges we know you are facing.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>We are a family-owned small business, believe strongly in family, and always endeavor to bring positivity to our customer interactions and community.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>We Love, Love, Love getting to know our customers and have many that have become our friends.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Let us hear from you.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Know that we value YOU, we value our FAMILIES, and we value our COMMUNITY</p>",
